[('Where should I start?', 'What you can bring from China, and how, depends on the product.'), ('Are these guides kept up to date?', "Each guide shows the date it was last updated and lists the official pages it was checked against. Rates and rules change with Pakistan's budgets, so check the date before relying on a number."), ('Do you handle bulk or wholesale orders?', 'No. We bring single items for personal or professional use. For bulk or stock, use a cargo company or the commercial import route.')],
